Package: DuckGeneSnap
Type: Project
Title: Static DuckDB-Wasm and DuckHTS Genomic Annotation App
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sounkou", "Toure", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Static browser-side genomics application using DuckDB-Wasm,
    DuckHTS, and Parquet assets to match local genotype and VCF/BCF files
    against locus-first variant annotations. An R pipeline builds the assets.
