URL: https://github.com/sounkou-bioinfo/DuckGeneSnap,
    https://sounkou-bioinfo.github.io/DuckGeneSnap/
BugReports: https://github.com/sounkou-bioinfo/DuckGeneSnap/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Imports:
    DBI,
